Subject: [PATCH 2573/3799] soh: rename func_80906538 ->
 BossGanon2_StampShadowLimbs

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: stamps each limb's stripe into the shadow texture, interpolating toward its parent limb by the caller's weight
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Ganon2/z_boss_ganon2.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Ganon2/z_boss_ganon2.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Ganon2/z_boss_ganon2.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Ganon2/z_boss_ganon2.c
index dc1704a0f..eade4486d 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Ganon2/z_boss_ganon2.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Ganon2/z_boss_ganon2.c
@@ -3079,7 +3079,8 @@ void BossGanon2_DrawEffects(PlayState* play) {
     CLOSE_DISPS(play->state.gfxCtx);
 }
 
-void func_80906538(BossGanon2* this, u8* shadowTexture, f32 arg2) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80906538: stamps each limb's stripe into the shadow texture, interpolating toward its parent limb by the caller's weight
+void BossGanon2_StampShadowLimbs(BossGanon2* this, u8* shadowTexture, f32 arg2) {
     s16 temp_t0;
     s16 temp_v0;
     s16 temp_a3;
@@ -3167,7 +3168,7 @@ void BossGanon2_GenShadowTexture(void* shadowTexture, BossGanon2* this, PlayStat
     Matrix_RotateX(1.0f, MTXMODE_NEW);
 
     for (i = 0; i < 6; i++) {
-        func_80906538(this, shadowTexture, i / 5.0f);
+        BossGanon2_StampShadowLimbs(this, shadowTexture, i / 5.0f);  // was func_80906538 [LLM:HIGH]
     }
 }
 
